  "title": "基础语法 5 点",
  "topics": [
    {
      "id": "g.present-simple",
      "title": "一般现在时",
      "titleEn": "Present simple",
      "summary": "描述习惯、日常和事实。重点：主语是 he / she / it（或单个的人、物）时，动词要变形。",
      "rules": [
        "主语是 I / you / we / they：动词不变。例：I like drawing.",
        "主语是 he / she / it（或单个的人、物）：动词加 s。例：She likes drawing.",
        "以 s / sh / ch / x / o 结尾的动词，加 es：go → goes，watch → watches。",
        "辅音字母 + y 结尾，把 y 变成 ies：study → studies。（play 是元音 + y，直接加 s：plays）",
        "have 很特殊：he has，不是 haves。",
        "否定句用 do not / does not（don't / doesn't），后面的动词变回原形，不再加 s：She doesn't like coffee.",
        "固定搭配：every day（每天）分开写；go home（回家）不加 to。",
        "疑问句：Do / Does 放句首，后面的动词用原形，不加 s：Does she like coffee?",
        "选 Do 还是 Does：先把主语换成代词。he / she / it（一个人、一个东西）用 Does，I / you / we / they（包括多个人，如 my friends）用 Do。",
        "回答用 do / does，不用动词：Yes, she does. / No, they don't."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "I like drawing.",
          "zh": "我喜欢画画。"
        },
        {
          "en": "She goes to school every day.",
          "zh": "她每天去上学。"
        },
        {
          "en": "He doesn't like coffee.",
          "zh": "他不喜欢咖啡。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Does he like drawing?",
          "zh": "他喜欢画画吗？"
        },
        {
          "en": "Do they play games on weekends?",
          "zh": "他们周末玩游戏吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "g.countable-uncountable",
      "title": "可数与不可数",
      "titleEn": "Countable and uncountable nouns",
      "summary": "名词分两类，决定了能不能加 s、用 many 还是 much、动词用 is 还是 are。",
      "rules": [
        "可数名词：能数出一个、两个，有复数形式。book → books。可以用 a / an、many、are。",
        "不可数名词：不能直接数，没有复数形式，不加 s。常见的：water、money、advice、information、homework、news、rice。",
        "不可数名词用 much（不用 many），动词用 is：There is much water.",
        "可数复数用 many，动词用 are：There are many books.",
        "a lot of 两种都可以用。",
        "some 两种都可以用：some water，some books。"
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "There is some water in the glass.",
          "zh": "杯子里有一些水。"
        },
        {
          "en": "There are many books on the desk.",
          "zh": "桌上有很多书。"
        },
        {
          "en": "I have a lot of homework.",
          "zh": "我有很多作业。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "g.past-simple",
      "title": "一般过去时",
      "titleEn": "Past simple",
      "summary": "描述过去已经发生的事。常和 yesterday、last week、last night 一起用。",
      "rules": [
        "规则动词加 ed：watch → watched，play → played。",
        "辅音 + y 结尾：y 变 i 再加 ed：study → studied。",
        "不规则动词要单独记，没有规则：go → went，have → had，buy → bought，see → saw，eat → ate。",
        "否定：did not（didn't）+ 动词原形：She didn't come.",
        "疑问：Did + 主语 + 动词原形：Did you do it?",
        "did 后面动词要变回原形，不再变过去式。"
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "I watched a movie last night.",
          "zh": "我昨晚看了一部电影。"
        },
        {
          "en": "She went to the park last Sunday.",
          "zh": "她上周日去了公园。"
        },
        {
          "en": "He didn't come to class.",
          "zh": "他没来上课。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "g.comparatives",
      "title": "比较级",
      "titleEn": "Comparatives",
      "summary": "比较两个人或物。结构：A + be + 比较级 + than + B。",
      "rules": [
        "短形容词（一个音节）加 er：tall → taller，cheap → cheaper。",
        "以一个元音 + 一个辅音结尾的短词，双写辅音再加 er：hot → hotter，big → bigger。",
        "辅音 + y 结尾，y 变 i 再加 er：happy → happier。",
        "长形容词（两个音节以上，多数）在前面加 more：more interesting，more beautiful。",
        "不能同时用 more 和 er（不说 more taller）。",
        "特殊的：good → better，bad → worse。",
        "“比”用 than（不是 then）。"
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "My brother is taller than me.",
          "zh": "我哥哥比我高。"
        },
        {
          "en": "This movie is more interesting than that one.",
          "zh": "这部电影比那部有趣。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Today is hotter than yesterday.",
          "zh": "今天比昨天热。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "g.if-conditional",
      "title": "if 条件句",
      "titleEn": "If-conditional (first conditional)",
      "summary": "“如果……就……”，说将来可能发生的事。",
      "rules": [
        "结构：If + 一般现在时，主句用 will + 动词原形。",
        "例：If it rains tomorrow, we will stay home.",
        "if 引导的那一半用现在时，不用 will。这是最常见的错误。",
        "if 句里的动词，主语是 he / she / it 时要加 s：If it rains...",
        "if 可以放前面，也可以放后面：We will stay home if it rains.",
        "放前面时，两个部分之间用逗号。"
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "If it rains tomorrow, we will stay home.",
          "zh": "如果明天下雨，我们就待在家里。"
        },
        {
          "en": "If I have time, I will call you.",
          "zh": "如果我有时间，我会打电话给你。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
